			"hadithnumber": 2362,
			"arabicnumber": 2362,
			"text": "Abdullah bin Mas'ud said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was asked, 'Which of the people are best?' He said: 'My generation, then those that follow them, then those that follow them. Then there will come people whose testimony precedes their oath and whose oath precedes their testimony.”",
